  "description": "A small, opinionated grab-bag of extension methods, helpers, and primitives shared across James Consulting LLC libraries. Includes string/byte/enum/object extensions (mask/redact, deep-clone, JSON), reflection helpers, async helpers, cryptography helpers, IHost initializer hooks, and more. Multi-targets netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, net9.0, net10.0.",
